{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Establish a national alert system for missing autistic & vulnerable people",
        "additional_details": "We have seen many vulnerable people, autistic children and other young people go missing. We believe a national alert system could help to drastically reduce the time it takes to find a child or young person. We hope this can lead to a safe and happy ending where the missing person is found.",
        "background": "The Government should introduce a national alert system which alerts every phone in a county when an autistic or vulnerable person goes missing.",
